  clock: 3  # 382e
  nonce: 382e  # 382e
  message: "2026-10-25 (owner-requested note, from a review of how WI-ziruv and WI-kosup bear on the open concept-audit rows): Two audits bear on this. (1) Part (a) moved to WI-higik and is WI-ziruv (falsify each declared axis's rule on real output)'s ADR-0027 counterexample. (2) Part (c): slice _CONTAINER_KINDS and type_like_kind_names are hand-written subsets of the symbol-kind vocabulary, a named instance in WI-kosup section D (subsets that drift when the vocabulary grows). The fix here does not wait for that sweep. A structural fix places every symbol kind in or out, rather than adding the three missing ones."  # 382e
